#: ../../source/users/interface/panels/undo_panel.rst:7
msgid "Undo panel"
msgstr "撤消面板"

#: ../../source/users/interface/panels/undo_panel.rst:9
msgid ""
"The Undo panel displays the history since the last time that the document "
"was saved. Once the `project`_ is saved, undo panel is automatically "
"cleared."
msgstr "撤消面板显示自文档上次保存以来的历史。 一旦保存了 `项目 <project_>`_，撤消面板将自动清除 。"

#: ../../source/users/interface/panels/undo_panel.rst:15
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech Undo panel"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech Undo 面板"

#: ../../source/users/interface/panels/undo_panel.rst:17
msgid "To display or hidden the undo panel:"
msgstr "要显示或隐藏撤消面板："

#: ../../source/users/interface/panels/undo_panel.rst:19
msgid "Select **Settings > Display > Undo** menu item."
msgstr "选择 **设置 > 显示 > 撤消** 菜单项。"

#: ../../source/users/interface/panels/undo_panel.rst:21
msgid ""
"The undo panel is used to return the `project`_ to the status after one of "
"the actions made after last save. By one click on one of the actions listed "
"at undo panel, the `project`_ will return to the status after the action "
"chosen at the panel. While the `project`_ is not saved again, the user can "
"go to the different status as many times he wants."
msgstr ""
"撤销面板用于在上次保存后完成动作后返回 `项目 <project_>`_ 状态。 通过点击撤消面板上列出的动作之一，`项目 <project_>`_ "
"将返回在面板上选择的动作后状态。 虽然 `项目 <project_>`_ 不再保存，但用户可以按他想要的多次返回不同的状态 。"

#: ../../source/users/interface/panels/undo_panel.rst:28
msgid ""
"If you play with the panel, be sure that you are at the correct history "
"status before continue working, saving `project`_ or any irreversible action"
" like `delete folio`_. Once the `project`_ is saved or an irreversible "
"action is made, the history is cleared."
msgstr ""
"如果您玩过面板，请确定您在继续工作前处于正确的历史状态，保存 `项目 <project_>`_ 或任何不可逆动作，如 `delete folio "
"<delete folio_>`_ 。 一旦保存 `项目 <project_>`_ 或采取不可逆的行动，历史就会被清除 。"

#: ../../source/users/interface/panels/undo_panel.rst:32
msgid "Using the undo panel allow you to:"
msgstr "使用撤消面板允许您："

#: ../../source/users/interface/panels/undo_panel.rst:34
msgid "Come back to previous steps with a click."
msgstr "点击后回到前几个步骤。"

#: ../../source/users/interface/panels/undo_panel.rst:35
msgid ""
"Recovering an object which was deleted before. The object can be recovered "
"going one step back before the deletion, `copying the object`_  and `pasting"
" the object`_ when on the latest version."
msgstr ""
"恢复之前已删除的天体。该天体可以在删除前退一步恢复， `复制对象 <copying the object_>`_  和 `粘贴对象 <pasting "
"the object_>`_ 当在最新版本。"

#: ../../source/users/interface/panels/undo_panel.rst:36
msgid "Checking the `project`_ status between versions."
msgstr "检查版本之间的 `项目 <project_>`_ 状态。"

#: ../../source/users/interface/panels/undo_panel.rst:37
msgid "Etc."
msgstr "Etc (英语)."
